# Optional UA -> devicevendor/devicemodel harvest (AstDB registrar/contact).
# Off by default. To enable on a home:
#   1. Uncomment the job below (or copy to a local override)
#   2. Ensure apply-sqlite-add-device-harvest.sh has been run
# Cadence: every 15 minutes. Spec: EXTENSION_PHONE_IMAGE_FROM_UA_REQUIREMENTS.md
#
# ASCII only in this file.
# Do NOT add ". /opt/pbx3/scripts/bashconfig" here — the shell script sources it.
# A second bashconfig include in cron.d yields "bad username" and the file is ignored.

# */15 * * * * root PBX3_HARVEST_DEVICEMODEL=1 /opt/pbx3/scripts/harvest-devicemodel.sh >>/var/log/pbx3-harvest-devicemodel.log 2>&1
